  <jpcrp_cor:PurposeOfShareholdingOverviewOfBusinessAllianceQuantitativeEffectsOfShareholdingAndReasonForIncreaseInNumberOfSharesDetailsOfDeemedHoldingsOfSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompany contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row4Member">議決権行使の指図権は当行が留保しております。</jpcrp_cor:PurposeOfShareholdingOverviewOfBusinessAllianceQuantitativeEffectsOfShareholdingAndReasonForIncreaseInNumberOfSharesDetailsOfDeemedHoldingsOfSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompany>
  <jpcrp_cor:WhetherIssuerOfAforementionedSharesHoldsReportingCompanysSharesDetailsOfDeemedHoldingsOfSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompany contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row4Member">有</jpcrp_cor:WhetherIssuerOfAforementionedSharesHoldsReportingCompanysSharesDetailsOfDeemedHoldingsOfSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompany>
  <jpcrp_cor:NameOfSecuritiesDetailsOfDeemedHoldingsOfEquitySecuritiesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompany contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row5Member">三菱商事株式会社</jpcrp_cor:NameOfSecuritiesDetailsOfDeemedHoldingsOfEquitySecuritiesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompany>
  <jpcrp_cor:PurposeOfShareholdingOverviewOfBusinessAllianceQuantitativeEffectsOfShareholdingAndReasonForIncreaseInNumberOfSharesDetailsOfDeemedHoldingsOfSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompany contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row5Member">議決権行使の指図権は当行が留保しております。株式数の増加は株式分割によるものです。</jpcrp_cor:PurposeOfShareholdingOverviewOfBusinessAllianceQuantitativeEffectsOfShareholdingAndReasonForIncreaseInNumberOfSharesDetailsOfDeemedHoldingsOfSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompany>
  <jpcrp_cor:WhetherIssuerOfAforementionedSharesHoldsReportingCompanysSharesDetailsOfDeemedHoldingsOfSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompany contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row5Member">無</jpcrp_cor:WhetherIssuerOfAforementionedSharesHoldsReportingCompanysSharesDetailsOfDeemedHoldingsOfSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompany>
  <jpcrp_cor:FootnotesDeemedHoldingsOfSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompanyTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row1Member">&lt;p class="smt_annoNum1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-right:13pt;"&gt;（注）１．貸借対照表計上額の大きい順の60銘柄を選定する段階で、特定投資株式とみなし保有株式を合算しておりません。&lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:FootnotesDeemedHoldingsOfSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompanyTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:FootnotesDeemedHoldingsOfSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompanyTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row2Member">&lt;p class="smt_annoNum2" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:49.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-18pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;"&gt; ２．みなし保有株式の保有の合理性については、資産運用協議会等において、銘柄毎ではなく年金又は退職一時金の信託財産のポートフォリオを構成する資産として保有が適切かについて検討しているため、銘柄毎の記載は困難であります。&lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:FootnotesDeemedHoldingsOfSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompanyTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:FootnotesDeemedHoldingsOfSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompanyTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row3Member">&lt;p class="smt_annoNum2" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:49.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-18pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;"&gt; ３．三菱電機株式会社は当行株式を保有しておりませんが、同社退職給付信託口として、日本マスタートラスト信託銀行株式会社が当行株式を保有しております。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:FootnotesDeemedHoldingsOfSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompanyTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:NameOfSecuritiesInvestmentEquitySecuritiesReclassifiedFromHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentToHeldForPureInvestmentReportingCompany contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row1Member">住友化学株式会社</jpcrp_cor:NameOfSecuritiesInvestmentEquitySecuritiesReclassifiedFromHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentToHeldForPureInvestmentReportingCompany>
  <jpcrp_cor:NameOfSecuritiesInvestmentEquitySecuritiesReclassifiedFromHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentToHeldForPureInvestmentReportingCompany contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row2Member">東京海上ホールディングス株式会社</jpcrp_cor:NameOfSecuritiesInvestmentEquitySecuritiesReclassifiedFromHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentToHeldForPureInvestmentReportingCompany>
  <jpcrp_cor:NameOfSecuritiesInvestmentEquitySecuritiesReclassifiedFromHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentToHeldForPureInvestmentReportingCompany contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row3Member">コニカミノルタ株式会社</jpcrp_cor:NameOfSecuritiesInvestmentEquitySecuritiesReclassifiedFromHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentToHeldForPureInvestmentReportingCompany>
  <jpcrp_cor:NameOfSecuritiesInvestmentEquitySecuritiesReclassifiedFromHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentToHeldForPureInvestmentReportingCompany contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row4Member">ＳＯＭＰＯホールディングス株式会社</jpcrp_cor:NameOfSecuritiesInvestmentEquitySecuritiesReclassifiedFromHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentToHeldForPureInvestmentReportingCompany>
  <jpcrp_cor:NameOfSecuritiesInvestmentEquitySecuritiesReclassifiedFromHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentToHeldForPureInvestmentReportingCompany contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row5Member">ＭＳ＆ＡＤインシュアランスグループホールディングス株式会社</jpcrp_cor:NameOfSecuritiesInvestmentEquitySecuritiesReclassifiedFromHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentToHeldForPureInvestmentReportingCompany>
